Positions invariant and float colour outputs NaN-guarded on every driver but NVIDIA's (from
Hookshot 395547c, NX2navi patches 0007 and 0027): OoT on AMD drew holes to the bright sky where the
colour pass's depth EQUAL test failed after the pre-pass, and glowing blocks where one NaN texel
went through bloom. EDEN_NX2_NO_INVARIANT=1 / EDEN_NX2_NO_NAN_GUARD=1 turn them off.

